@scalability1 – we have a task on figuring out Networking for virtual participants. All ideas are welcome! 

We used one platform for the hybdrid TPM Meetup, which did not meet our expectations. 

At the very least we will have a private channel (or server), but we are also looking for more engaging experience!

Hey TPMs! 🌟

#tpm-trails Bay Area Chapter just announced the next event! Check it out and secure your spot! 

Great line up of speakers:

@Vivian Shen – Sr. Principal TPM @ Splunk! Vivian has tremendous experience in cloud infrastructure and operations! 

@Param Krish – Staff TPM @ Robinhood Infrastructure! Param and I used to manage tons of migrations! He has lots of first hand infrastructure experience!

@Kevin Khaw – TPM Director at Waymo! My close friend and mentor! I often look for his advice in challenging situations! 

It will be an amazing Summer Edition event at office of Coda in Mountain View, CA on June 26th! Thanks to our friends from Coda - @Al Chen @Jane Chiu!

https://events.tpmevents.org/demystifying-infrastructure-tpms
